### CRM REST API Test Collection
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Register New Counselor / Employee
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Michael Scott",
  "email": "michael.counselor@company.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "+1-555-0301",
  "role": "counselor"
}

### 3. Login as Counselor 1 (John Doe)
# @name loginJohn
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.counselor@company.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Store John's token
@johnToken = {{loginJohn.response.body.data.token}}

### 4. Login as Counselor 2 (Sarah Smith)
# @name loginSarah
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sarah.counselor@company.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Store Sarah's token
@sarahToken = {{loginSarah.response.body.data.token}}

### 5. Get Logged-in Counselor Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{johnToken}}

### 6. Public Form API - Submit New Enquiry (NO AUTHENTICATION REQUIRED)
# @name submitEnquiry
POST {{baseUrl}}/enquiries/public
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Robert Downey",
  "email": "robert.d@example.com",
  "phone": "+1-555-7777",
  "courseInterest": "Full Stack Web Development (MERN)",
  "notes": "Interested in full-time batch starting next month.",
  "source": "online_form"
}

### 7. Fetch Unclaimed Leads (Public Enquiries inside CRM)
GET {{baseUrl}}/enquiries/unclaimed?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{johnToken}}

### 8. Search Unclaimed Leads by Course
GET {{baseUrl}}/enquiries/unclaimed?course=Data%20Science
Authorization: Bearer {{johnToken}}

### 9. Claim an Enquiry (Assigns lead to John Doe)
# Replace 1 with any unclaimed enquiry ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/enquiries/1/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{johnToken}}

### 10. Attempt to Claim Already Claimed Enquiry by Sarah (Should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/enquiries/1/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{sarahToken}}

### 11. Fetch Leads Claimed by John Doe (My Claims)
GET {{baseUrl}}/enquiries/my-claims
Authorization: Bearer {{johnToken}}

### 12. Fetch Leads Claimed by Sarah Smith (My Claims)
GET {{baseUrl}}/enquiries/my-claims
Authorization: Bearer {{sarahToken}}

### 13. Update Status and Follow-up Notes for Claimed Enquiry
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/enquiries/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{johnToken}}

{
  "status": "CONTACTED",
  "notes": "Had a 15-minute phone consultation. Scheduled syllabus walkthrough for Friday."
}

### 14. Get Enquiry Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/enquiries/1
Authorization: Bearer {{johnToken}}
